{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>תחת אהבתי</b> — the yod of אהבתי is a sign of the verb." "<b>ואני תפלה</b> — a man of prayer. And the meaning: that I would pray to HaShem on their behalf, in the manner of: 'And as for me, when they were sick, my clothing was sackcloth' [Psalm 35:13]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 109, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:39:09.753003249Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}